WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.966 --> 00:00:03.002
-Rudy Giuliani's defenders

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:05.771
are claiming the FBI raids
of his home and office

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:06.973
are part of a conspiracy

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:09.108
by the Biden administration
to target him,

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:10.577
even though
the investigation started

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.178
during the Trump administration.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:14.580
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.684
♪♪

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:20.653
I should warn you
that we are standing by

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:23.156
for some breaking news
and we're ready, at any moment,

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:26.092
for NBC to cut into this program
for live coverage

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:28.494
of what could be
an earth-shattering event

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:31.130
because, over the weekend,
a few days after the FBI

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.732
raided his home and office,
Rudy Giuliani told reporters

00:00:33.732 --> 00:00:36.335
that he was about to drop
a major bombshell.

00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:38.271 line:0%
-Mr. Mayor. What do you think
about's going on?

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:41.340 line:0%
-People want a statement
about this whole thing.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.942 line:0%
I'll break something really big

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:44.043 line:0%
later this afternoon

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:46.046 line:0%
in Weehawken, New Jersey.

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:49.749
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:51.317
-Hmm?

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:53.419
Oh!
Oh, we're still on?

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:55.588
I assumed NBC News had cut in
for live coverage

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:57.856
of Rudy's announcement
from Weehawken,

00:00:57.856 --> 00:01:00.626
only to report that Rudy
was actually in Piscataway

00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:03.163
and got confused because both
Weehawken and Piscataway

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:05.364
remind him of taking a leak.

00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:06.966
[ Laughter ]
[ As Johnny Carson ] Weehawken.

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:09.102
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:10.837
You know, you know, Wally,
you know how

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:13.105
you get to Piscataway?
-No.

00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:14.307
-Go piss that-a-way.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:19.879
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.213
[ Regular voice ]
I'm guessing the Weehawken thing

00:01:21.213 --> 00:01:23.783
was not actually a real tease
for a press conference

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:25.751
because Rudy was also holding
the biography

00:01:25.751 --> 00:01:27.987
of Alexander Hamilton
that inspired the hit musical

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.789
and Weehawken is where the duel

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:31.924
between Hamilton and Aaron Burr
took place.

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:34.360
I'm guessing Rudy has
some secret information

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.729
that proves Hamilton
actually won the duel.

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:39.432
[ As Giuliani ]
And, now I'm going to turn it
over to my ballistics expert,

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:40.600
Mike Lindell.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.102
[ As Lindell ]
We have proof that Hamilton

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:44.938
was wearing a pillow
under his shirt

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.839
and everyone knows a bullet

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:48.641
can't go through a pillow.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:51.544
Well, it can't go
through a MyPillow.

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:52.778
[ As Giuliani ]
Thanks, Mike. You can go.

00:01:52.778 --> 00:01:55.048
[ As Lindell ]
But I don't got anywhere to go.

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:57.817
[ Laughter ]
Of course, it's also possible

00:01:57.817 --> 00:01:59.085
Rudy picked up the book

00:01:59.085 --> 00:02:01.687
thinking it was a giant stack
of $10 bills.

00:02:01.687 --> 00:02:03.055
[ As Giuliani ]
Oh, Rudy!

00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:04.757
You're gonna be rich!

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.826
Driver, take me
to Tavern on the Green.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.294
Tell them to give me
my usual table,

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:09.862
out back behind the Dumpster.

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:12.398
One of the raccoons has
some dirt on Joe Biden.

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:14.500
In fact, Rudy was apparently
holding the book

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.503
because he's supposedly
in the process of filming

00:02:17.503 --> 00:02:20.039
some sort of documentary
special about Hamilton.

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:22.107 line:0%
-Following the FBI raid
of his home and office,

00:02:22.107 --> 00:02:24.577 line:0%
Donald Trump's former attorney
is pushing back

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:27.513 line:0%
on the quick-developing story
of his potential crimes

00:02:27.513 --> 00:02:29.515 line:0%
and has found the time to shoot

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:31.317 line:0%
a Hamilton documentary.

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:36.155 line:0%
-Today, we're filming
the places in New York

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:38.124 line:0%
that Alexander Hamilton

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:40.760 line:0%
really stayed, really went,
really lived.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.761
-A Hamilton documentary?

00:02:42.761 --> 00:02:44.163
Way to strike while the iron is

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:45.431
ice cold.

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:47.433
Of course, knowing Rudy,
there's a good chance

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:49.369
Rudy's outside
Lin-Manuel Miranda's house

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:50.937
with a film crew right now.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:53.138
[ As Giuliani ]
And this is where
Hamilton learned to rap,

00:02:53.138 --> 00:02:55.842
or, as Hamilton himself
famously put it, this is --

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:56.943
♪ The room where it took place ♪

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:58.344
♪ The room
where it took place ♪

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:01.180
[ Laughter ]
Now, let's see
if we can get inside.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.849
Mr. Hamilton!

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:05.351
It's the FBI! We have a warrant!
This is perfectly legal.

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:06.752
Somebody just did it to me
last week.

00:03:06.752 --> 00:03:08.321
[ Laughter ]
Rudy sounds like

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:10.156
some Upper East Side scam artist

00:03:10.156 --> 00:03:12.558
who does walking tours
for out-of-towners,

00:03:12.558 --> 00:03:14.460
but doesn't actually know
what he's talking about.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.195
[ As Giuliani ]
Okay, today we're going
to all the places

00:03:16.195 --> 00:03:18.731
where Alexander really stayed,
really went, really lived.

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:21.100
Over here, for example,
is a Famous Ray's Pizza,

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.202
which is famous for the time
Hamilton went in and said,

00:03:23.202 --> 00:03:25.171
"You know, I don't think
I could eat a whole pizza.

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:26.672
Would you guys
maybe sell me a slice?"

00:03:26.672 --> 00:03:29.742
And that's how, you know,
that whole industry got started.

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:31.143
In fact, during his
little press conference

00:03:31.143 --> 00:03:32.878
about his Hamilton documentary,
Rudy claimed

00:03:32.878 --> 00:03:36.015
Hamilton would agree with him
on at least one thing.

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:37.616 line:0%
-We're going to remind
the whole world

00:03:37.616 --> 00:03:39.918 line:0%
New York was the first capital

00:03:39.918 --> 00:03:41.954 line:0%
of the United States.

00:03:41.954 --> 00:03:43.689 line:0%
And you know what Hamilton
would agree with me on?

00:03:43.689 --> 00:03:45.291 line:0%
It's the capital of the world.

00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:46.392
[ Laughter ]
[ As Giuliani ]
You can see I'm reading it.

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:48.594
I got bookmarks.

00:03:48.594 --> 00:03:50.196
I love that, when things
get bad for Rudy,

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:52.565
he always falls back on,
"New York City, baby!"

00:03:52.565 --> 00:03:54.333
But that ship has sailed, pal.

00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:56.803
You're never going to be
in a Yankees commercial again.

00:03:56.803 --> 00:03:58.337
They're not going to have
a smiling picture of you

00:03:58.337 --> 00:04:00.006
giving a thumbs-up at JFK.

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:01.741
Your voice isn't going to play

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.910
when people get
into New York City taxis.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:05.644
[ As Giuliani ]
This is former
Mayor Rudy Giuliani

00:04:05.644 --> 00:04:07.513
reminding you
to buckle up for safety.

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:09.982
And also, that ghosts voted
in Pennsylvania,

00:04:09.982 --> 00:04:11.884
which is the only reason
Joe Biden won.

00:04:11.884 --> 00:04:14.019
[ Laughter ]
And I know New York City
discontinued

00:04:14.019 --> 00:04:16.555
celebrity messages
in cabs in 2003,

00:04:16.555 --> 00:04:18.123
but I feel like Rudy's
the kind of guy

00:04:18.123 --> 00:04:20.059
who would record them
on cassettes

00:04:20.059 --> 00:04:22.295
and then just leave them
in the backseat.

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:24.130
Now, Rudy's been doing
a lot of friendly media,

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:26.699
telling his side of the story,
but, on multiple occasions,

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:29.401
including on his own podcast
and in those interviews,

00:04:29.401 --> 00:04:30.970
he's seemingly gone
out of his way

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:33.872
to implicate his former boss,
Donald Trump.

00:04:33.872 --> 00:04:35.375 line:0%
-I mean, the documents
they seized,

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:38.344 line:0%
easily, half of them involve
my representation

00:04:38.344 --> 00:04:40.213 line:0%
of the president of the
United States as a lawyer.

00:04:52.591 --> 00:04:54.293
-Yeah, and he's also
under multiple

00:04:54.293 --> 00:04:56.129
criminal investigations.
I don't think that sounds

00:04:56.129 --> 00:04:58.163
as exculpatory
as you think it does.

00:04:58.163 --> 00:04:59.699
[ As Giuliani ]
I'm not corrupt.
I was just working,

00:04:59.699 --> 00:05:02.168
day and night,
for someone who was corrupt.

00:05:02.168 --> 00:05:03.769
And I know what he's saying,
which is a lot

00:05:03.769 --> 00:05:06.038
of the communications
and documents are covered

00:05:06.038 --> 00:05:09.208
by attorney-client privilege,
which I get, and that's true.

00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:11.377
But I'm not sure everything
on Rudy's devices

00:05:11.377 --> 00:05:13.112
was covered
by attorney-client privilege,

00:05:13.112 --> 00:05:16.782
since, you know, he went on TV
and read it aloud to everyone.

00:05:16.782 --> 00:05:19.318 line:0%
-I never talked [ Laughing ]
to a Ukrainian official

00:05:19.318 --> 00:05:20.886 line:0%
until the State Department
called me

00:05:20.886 --> 00:05:22.220 line:0%
and asked me to do it.

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:24.757 line:0%
And then, I reported every
conversation back to them.

00:05:24.757 --> 00:05:28.026 line:0%
It's all here, right here,

00:05:28.026 --> 00:05:29.795 line:0%
the first call
from the State Department.

00:05:29.795 --> 00:05:32.198 line:0%
Here's Kurt saying,
"Great. I will tell Yermak

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:34.233 line:0%
and he'll visit with you there.
Thanks."

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:37.103 line:0%
Mr. Mayor, how was your meeting
with Andriy?

00:05:37.103 --> 00:05:38.971 line:0%
Do you have time for a call?

00:05:38.971 --> 00:05:41.173 line:0%
Best, Kurt."

00:05:41.173 --> 00:05:43.109 line:0%
They were all over me,

00:05:43.109 --> 00:05:44.376 line:0%
you know, asking me to do it.

00:05:44.376 --> 00:05:46.212 line:0%
I was happy to do it.

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:47.880
-I'm no legal expert,
but I'm pretty sure

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.415
attorney-client privilege
goes away

00:05:49.415 --> 00:05:51.884
when you read the documents
aloud on national television.

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:53.719
[ As Giuliani ]
Okay, you're all my clients!

00:05:53.719 --> 00:05:55.687
It's like
the dumb-criminal version

00:05:55.687 --> 00:05:57.323
of your grandma reading you
a funny meme

00:05:57.323 --> 00:05:58.958
she came across on Facebook.

00:05:58.958 --> 00:06:00.893
[ New York accent ]
Look, Gladys sent this to me.

00:06:00.893 --> 00:06:03.096
It's a picture of a grandma
and the caption says,

00:06:03.096 --> 00:06:05.898
'Do emails
get delivered on Sundays?'

00:06:05.898 --> 00:06:07.099
Isn't that great?

00:06:07.099 --> 00:06:08.867
That Gladys.

00:06:08.867 --> 00:06:11.170
I swear, all her bones
are funny bones.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:12.571
Now, in case you
don't remember --

00:06:12.571 --> 00:06:14.407
and I really hope, for the sake
of your mental health,

00:06:14.407 --> 00:06:15.808
that you don't --
this whole thing

00:06:15.808 --> 00:06:18.210
apparently revolves
around a scheme cooked up

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.579
by Rudy and his gang of weirdos

00:06:19.579 --> 00:06:22.247
to dig up dirt on the Bidens
during the election

00:06:22.247 --> 00:06:24.750
and extort Ukraine,
in order to get that dirt,

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.119
which is what Trump was
impeached for the first time.

00:06:27.119 --> 00:06:29.522
Rudy tried to get
the then-ambassador to Ukraine,

00:06:29.522 --> 00:06:31.691
Marie Yovanovitch, pushed out

00:06:31.691 --> 00:06:34.059
because he saw her
as an obstacle to his scheme,

00:06:34.059 --> 00:06:36.528
and that's what the feds
are reportedly investigating.

00:06:36.528 --> 00:06:38.130
And, by the way,
Rudy has basically

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:39.331
already admitted to that.

00:06:39.331 --> 00:06:40.700 line:0%
-I do not understand

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:43.169 line:0%
Mr. Giuliani's motives
for attacking me,

00:06:43.169 --> 00:06:45.805 line:0%
nor can I offer an opinion
on whether he believed

00:06:45.805 --> 00:06:48.507 line:0%
the allegations
he spread about me.

00:06:48.507 --> 00:06:51.410 line:0%
Clearly, no one
at the State Department did.

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:53.212 line:0%
When I returned
to the United States,

00:06:53.212 --> 00:06:55.447 line:0%
Deputy Secretary of State
Sullivan

00:06:55.447 --> 00:06:58.551 line:0%
told me there had been
a concerted campaign against me.

00:06:58.551 --> 00:07:00.452
-This hit piece --
and it's a hit piece --

00:07:00.452 --> 00:07:02.287
-Of course.
-also has you on the record,

00:07:02.287 --> 00:07:06.692 line:0%
admitting that you
forced out Marie Yovanovich.

00:07:06.692 --> 00:07:07.926 line:0%
-Of course I did.
-You said you needed her

00:07:07.926 --> 00:07:09.695 line:0%
out of the way.
But you're a personal attorney

00:07:09.695 --> 00:07:12.197 line:0%
for the president, so why do you
need her out of the way?

00:07:12.197 --> 00:07:13.732 line:0%
-I didn't need her
out of the way.

00:07:13.732 --> 00:07:15.701 line:0%
I forced her out
because she's corrupt.

00:07:15.701 --> 00:07:18.237
-It's nice when the confession
comes before the indictment.

00:07:18.237 --> 00:07:20.573
Usually, you have to arrest
a suspect, first,

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:21.907
get them
in an interrogation room,

00:07:21.907 --> 00:07:24.143
and start grilling them.
Rudy just shows up, saying --

00:07:24.143 --> 00:07:25.144
[ As Giuliani ]
You want the truth?

00:07:25.144 --> 00:07:26.178
You can't handle the truth.

00:07:26.178 --> 00:07:27.847
We do want the truth,
but, sheesh,

00:07:27.847 --> 00:07:29.348
we don't even
have our pens out.

00:07:29.348 --> 00:07:31.784
And, by the way, it's amazing
that these guys are so corrupt,

00:07:31.784 --> 00:07:34.720
they're still being investigated
for what they were accused of

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.355
during Trump's
first impeachment trial,

00:07:36.355 --> 00:07:38.123
which, if I'm remembering
correctly,

00:07:38.123 --> 00:07:39.892
was approximately
eight hundred years ago.

00:07:39.892 --> 00:07:41.427
In fact, last week,
Rudy brought it up

00:07:41.427 --> 00:07:42.995
out of nowhere
when he tweeted...

00:07:52.938 --> 00:07:55.541
Sorry, wait.
So the Trump Justice Department,

00:07:55.541 --> 00:07:57.877
run by William Barr,
searched your iCloud

00:07:57.877 --> 00:08:00.145
during your impeachment
defense of Trump?

00:08:00.145 --> 00:08:03.115
So it was Trump trying
to arrest you this whole time?

00:08:03.115 --> 00:08:04.349
[ As Trump ]
You got to put him behind bars,

00:08:04.349 --> 00:08:06.318
otherwise, he's going
to keep calling me

00:08:06.318 --> 00:08:07.519
and inviting me on this

00:08:07.519 --> 00:08:09.588
Hamilton Walking Tour.

00:08:09.588 --> 00:08:11.957
He also says he has a new
Abraham Lincoln Walking Tour,

00:08:11.957 --> 00:08:15.761
but I think he just wants to go
to four different Scores,

00:08:15.761 --> 00:08:17.363
even though they closed
seven years ago.

00:08:17.363 --> 00:08:18.631
[ Laughter ]

00:08:18.631 --> 00:08:20.766
And yet, Rudy claimed,
on Fox News last week,

00:08:20.766 --> 00:08:23.302
that the raid, which, again,
is part of an investigation

00:08:23.302 --> 00:08:24.803
that started
when Trump was president,

00:08:24.803 --> 00:08:26.939
was somehow a plot orchestrated

00:08:26.939 --> 00:08:29.608
by Biden and the Democrats
to target him.

00:08:29.608 --> 00:08:32.144 line:0%
-Joe Biden says he didn't know

00:08:32.144 --> 00:08:33.578 line:0%
that this raid was coming.

00:08:33.578 --> 00:08:35.481 line:0%
Do you take that at face value?

00:08:38.484 --> 00:08:40.085 line:0%
-Maybe he doesn't remember.

00:08:40.085 --> 00:08:41.854 line:0%
I'm not sure
if he can retain anything

00:08:41.854 --> 00:08:44.657 line:0%
for more than about, you know,
the time it takes to read it.

00:08:44.657 --> 00:08:46.792
-Yeah, sure, dude,
Biden's the senile one, here.

00:08:46.792 --> 00:08:48.360
You're the one
butt-dialing reporters,

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.028
only using the top Crest strip,

00:08:50.028 --> 00:08:51.530
and wandering around the
streets of New York,

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:53.699
telling people you're filming
a TV special about Hamilton.

00:08:53.699 --> 00:08:54.834
Every time you do an interview,

00:08:54.834 --> 00:08:56.702
you look like
an ailing grandfather

00:08:56.702 --> 00:08:59.204
having a flashback to the war
during a family gathering.

00:08:59.204 --> 00:09:00.339
[ As Giuliani ]
I cheated on my wife.

00:09:00.339 --> 00:09:03.408
I have to tell Father Mulcahy!

00:09:03.408 --> 00:09:04.510
"M-A-S-H."

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:05.978
[ Laughter ]

00:09:05.978 --> 00:09:07.980
I mean, what would you
consider senile,

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:10.916
not knowing the name of the
person you're talking to?

00:09:10.916 --> 00:09:12.918
-Also, Hunter, I am a lawyer.

00:09:12.918 --> 00:09:15.154
-[ Laughing ] Oh, boy,
when Grandpa starts calling you

00:09:15.154 --> 00:09:16.488
by his dead wife's name,

00:09:16.488 --> 00:09:18.658
it's time to give him an Ambien
and put him to bed.

00:09:18.658 --> 00:09:20.359
Just make sure
to give him a bedpan,

00:09:20.359 --> 00:09:22.261
in case he has to take a...
[ As Carson ] Piscataway.

00:09:22.261 --> 00:09:25.965
[ Laughter ]

00:09:25.965 --> 00:09:27.033
Did you hear me, Wally?

00:09:27.033 --> 00:09:28.167
[ Laughter ]

00:09:28.167 --> 00:09:29.235
-Yes.

00:09:29.235 --> 00:09:30.369
[ Laughter ]

00:09:30.369 --> 00:09:31.837
-The Rudy story is,
among other things,

00:09:31.837 --> 00:09:33.405
a reminder of just how corrupt
and paranoid

00:09:33.405 --> 00:09:35.875
the Republican Party and its
right-wing apparatus still are.

00:09:35.875 --> 00:09:37.376
They see themselves
as above the law

00:09:37.376 --> 00:09:39.845
and they consider any attempt
to hold them accountable

00:09:39.845 --> 00:09:41.914
a shadowy plot
by their political opponents,

00:09:41.914 --> 00:09:44.249
even though it was
Trump's own DOJ

00:09:44.249 --> 00:09:46.018
that started the investigation
into Rudy.

00:09:46.018 --> 00:09:48.521
I don't know if the feds
will arrest Rudy or not,

00:09:48.521 --> 00:09:49.722
but, if they're looking for him,

00:09:49.722 --> 00:09:50.755
they can probably find him...

00:09:50.755 --> 00:09:52.157 line:0%
-Later this afternoon

00:09:52.157 --> 00:09:54.160 line:0%
